# a track's level: KNOB 1 of the SEL page (volume), and KNOB 1 on the CLIPS page; the EDIT page has none of it
expect level 100
tap SEL
expect view 6
turn K1 -5
expect level 90
shot level_sel.png
tap HOME
expect view 2
turn K1 3
expect level 96
shot level_home.png
# another track keeps its own level
tapkey b2
expect level 100
turn K1 -10
expect level 80
tapkey b0
expect level 96
# a track whose engine has no pots still has its level (track 10 has no engine)
tapkey b9
tap SEL
expect view 6
turn K1 -5
expect level 90
